Responsibilities
This role is needed to review equipment operation, maintenance, fault, and energy data, identify inefficiencies, and support optimization of maintenance strategies and resource allocation.
- Assist in collecting, cleaning, and organizing data related to facility operations, equipment maintenance, fault records, and energy consumption;
- Support data analysis to identify trends, anomalies, and operational inefficiencies;
- Help prepare routine reports, dashboards, and data summaries for management review;
- Assist in tracking key performance indicators related to equipment operation, maintenance response, and resource utilization;
- Provide data support for process improvement and other ad hoc analysis tasks within the Facility Management team.
